s/c275422dd729fd81b06c193d965ccd81.avif?t=1755762881\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of choices and endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arriving at this dilapidated inn by fate, every tiny choice you make will lead the story to a different development. You will encounter unpredictable and completely different terrifying events and lead to more than twenty different endings. Among them, there is only one way to ultimately escape. Lucky you, can you make the right choice?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914000/extras/8feb8fd9d9e53c2e124d9703a0414901.avif?t=1755762881\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refuse to be startled by jumping faces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of sudden loud sound effects and sudden face scares? Don't worry. There won't be such heart-damaging elements here. &quot;Fu Sha&quot; is more like a traditional horror film. It neither overuses scares to create high energy nor loses the spine-chilling horror atmosphere. It might even extend beyond the game...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914000/extras/18d90935ad47cbd39ba90e003be5b8b4.avif?t=1755762881\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow-up story plan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fu Sha&quot; itself is a complete story, and it is also the beginning of a hidden understory. In future sequels, we will continue to present more unique horror stories, and the understory will gradually emerge within them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase suggestion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's suitable for cooling off in summer and giving as a gift to friends.</p>","developers":["1\u53f7\u89c2\u6d4b\u5458","2\u53f7\u89c2\u6d4